{"articleNo":"2651","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2651&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"복수전공 및 부전공 이수 포기(변경) 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.09","hit":"11416","attachments":[{"name":"부전공이수포기신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2651&attachNo=2390"},{"name":"복수전공이수포기(변경)신청서~.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2651&attachNo=2620"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">복수전공 및 부전공 이수 포기(변경) 신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">010학년도 2학기 복수전공 및 부전공 이수 포기(변경)에 관한 사항을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> 아래와</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 같이 안내하오니 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;1. 신청 기간&nbsp; : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 11. 16(화) ～ 11. 18(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2. 신청 장소&nbsp; : 복수전공 및 부전공 해당 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“종합학사행정실”</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 177.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -177.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">복수전공포기(변경)자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> : 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(날인)&nbsp;&nbsp; 한 후 복수전공(변경) 학부장에게 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 5.7pt\">부전공포기자 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">: 신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">유(날인)&nbsp;&nbsp; 한 후 부전공 학부장에게 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">3. 제출 서류 : 포기(변경)신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;4. 참고사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 49pt; TEXT-INDENT: -49pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 복</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 이수 성적</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">이 평점</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">평균 3.00이상 이어야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 복</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">수전공 및 부전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">일반선택학점으로,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 부전공으로 변경 시에는 부전공학점으로 인정함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 49.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -49.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">다. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">졸</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">업 대상자 중에서 복수전공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">되었으나</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수가 불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 11. 9.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
